&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; font-size: 13pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Garamond; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; font-variant: small-caps; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; color: #365f91;"&gt;Leases:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Partnership leases its &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;corporate &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;office &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;and one field office &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;space under operating lease arrangements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;On &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;April 1,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; the Partnership &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;amended its &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;field&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; office lease extending the lease for another &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;five&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; years.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;On June 1, 2025 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;lease &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;for the corporate headquarter office in Shelton, CT &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;was amended to include an extension of current leased space&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;No additional years were added to the lease terms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The leases expire at various dates through 20&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;have options to extend or terminate the leases&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;For purposes of calculating ROU asset and operating lease liabilities, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;the Partnership deemed that it was reasonable that they would exercise the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;5-year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; extension of the agreement that is present &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;with its field &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;office and included the 5-year extension in the ROU assets and liabilities calculation. With regards to the corporate office &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;contract,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; it was not reasonably certain that the extension would be exercised and therefore was excluded from the ROU assets and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;liabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 150%; font-size: 3pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The following are the components of lease costs (in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;thousands&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;, except for lease terms and discount rate):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table style="width: 381.6pt; margin-left: 45pt; border-collapse: collapse;" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 3.3pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 114.3pt; border-bottom: 1.5pt solid #002060; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: top;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 13.7pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;At December 31 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
