&lt;p style="margin: 20pt 13.7pt 0pt 9.35pt; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The accumulated benefit obligation for the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Partnership&amp;#8217;s retirement benefit plans &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;was&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;million&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; million&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; at December 31, 20&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; and 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
