&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;"&gt;The components of the net deferred tax liability are as follows:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 13.7pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table class="MsoNormalTable" style="margin-left: 5.4pt;" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"&gt;
