  <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutIncorporationOfTheRespondentDescription id="HHBB9B076826E9D1F8B655843DF3313C9F" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">Iroquois Gas Transmission System, LP ("IGTS") was registered as a limited partnership in Deleware on 12/1/89. Iroquois Pipeline Operating Company ("IPOC"), established on 2/28/89 as a Delaware corporation for the purpose of administering the operations of IGTS. On 3/25/96, IGTS acquired from TransCanada Pipeline USA Ltd., (an affiliate of TransCanada Iroquois Ltd., one of Iroquois, partners) all of the outstanding stock of IPOC</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutIncorporationOfTheRespondentDescription>
