    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHFFB5B9CBBCE020BB57AA5A9B3F92EECA" xlink:to="HHFE5892DAC1ADFCC11C894437A9B51B60" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH2119B2D42B95B6D8FFD62581BA2F8233" xlink:label="HH2119B2D42B95B6D8FFD62581BA2F8233" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH9DF54717E4B764FF3565699996D3F1DF" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
The Milford Lateral is 200 feet.

</div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH2119B2D42B95B6D8FFD62581BA2F8233" xlink:to="HH9DF54717E4B764FF3565699996D3F1DF" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH7657DAE6E44E9662B073047DA048E4E9" xlink:label="HH7657DAE6E44E9662B073047DA048E4E9" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH70B9717640537DDF06E9E076EA00169A" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
Iroquois charges fuel-in-kind based on Monthly Measurement Variance/Fuel Use Factors. Over/under collections of natural gas are trued-up through adjustments to the Monthly Measurement Variance/Fuel Use Factors that Iroquois charges its customers in future months pursuant to Section 2.27 of the General Terms and Conditions of Iroquois FERC Gas Tariff. As a result, no cash is transferred between Iroquois and Iroquois shippers for fuel and measurement variances including Lost and Unaccounted for Gas.</div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH7657DAE6E44E9662B073047DA048E4E9" xlink:to="HH70B9717640537DDF06E9E076EA00169A" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH3780860CD8C14106196348ABB4B69C5D" xlink:label="HH3780860CD8C14106196348ABB4B69C5D" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHFFC67FE377264424CE56FB104FBD9502" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Iroquois charges fuel-in-kind based on Monthly Measurement Variance/Fuel Use Factors. Over/under collections of natural gas are trued-up through adjustments to the Monthly Measurement Variance/Fuel Use Factors that Iroquois charges its customers in future months pursuant to Section 2.27 of the General Terms and Conditions of Iroquois FERC Gas Tariff. As a result, no cash is transferred between Iroquois and Iroquois shippers for fuel and measurement variances including Lost and Unaccounted for Gas.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH3780860CD8C14106196348ABB4B69C5D" xlink:to="HHFFC67FE377264424CE56FB104FBD9502" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH1FDFF231C57557180D0D94B1AA028881" xlink:label="HH1FDFF231C57557180D0D94B1AA028881" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH09645C6392C8EF5C3FBAA0F6B0FD079B" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The revenues reported in this column consist of ALL transportation revenues associated with negotiated rate contracts. 
</div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH1FDFF231C57557180D0D94B1AA028881" xlink:to="HH09645C6392C8EF5C3FBAA0F6B0FD079B" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH56279192B35448FC1BA5EB21D5DE276D" xlink:label="HH56279192B35448FC1BA5EB21D5DE276D" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH7252CA2AABD5D6AD29A86B1F6303F697" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The volumes reported in this column consist of volumes in Dth associated with transport under negotiated rate contracts.
</div>
    </link:footnote>
