      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The quantities reported in this column are a pro-rata apportionment of the quantity reported on this page and line in column (e) based on the ratio of scheduled transportation quantities associated with recourse rates and the total scheduled transportation quantities for the applicable period.

