    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH694B15386301D1C61A6D06F8BD7F7BFA" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>The quantities reported in this column are a pro-rata apportionment of the quantity reported on this page and line in column (e) based on the ratio of scheduled transportation quantities associated with recourse rates and the total scheduled transportation quantities for the applicable period. This applies to Pages 521a-M1, 521b-M1, 521a-M2, 521b-M2, 521a-M3, and 521b-M3.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH7633CD4E75A567054BBBE78A1D58F688" xlink:to="HH694B15386301D1C61A6D06F8BD7F7BFA" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH5396059D1C7B38CAAF26705133086FBC" xlink:label="HH5396059D1C7B38CAAF26705133086FBC" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH52F7B929E81224213BE28D5041EC9A54" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Iroquois charges fuel-in-kind based on Monthly Fuel &amp; Losses Retention (F&amp;LR) Factors.  Over/under collections of natural gas are trued-up through adjustments to the F&amp;LR Factors that Iroquois charges its customers in future months pursuant to Section 36 of the General Terms and Conditions of Iroquois&#8217; FERC Gas Tariff.

As a result, no cash is transferred between Iroquois and Iroquois&#8217; shippers for fuel and measurement variances including Lost and Unaccounted for Gas.

Iroquois has valued the gas reported in months 1, 2, and 3 using the PAL and HUB Credit Index Price in effect as of November 1, 2025, December 1, 2025, and January 1, 2026 respectively.

</div>
    </link:footnote>
