    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH5BFB15B298FFB003CDA666C330EFA4FC" xlink:label="HH5BFB15B298FFB003CDA666C330EFA4FC" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHF99FB8D9DFC3485348EEEAC564A4D538" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Iroquois system balance report, which is used to compile the data required for FERC form 3-Q and this FERC Form 2, does not have OBA balances and PAL/HUB Injections/Withdrawals broken out by zone or rate schedule.</p>
        <p>Iroquois does not have no-notice service</p>
        <p>Iroquois does not currently have shipper imbalances since it has OBAs in place at all of its points.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH5BFB15B298FFB003CDA666C330EFA4FC" xlink:to="HHF99FB8D9DFC3485348EEEAC564A4D538" order="1" />
